00:09:03.499 --> 00:09:04.518
EFFORT FAILED, THE DEMOCRATS

00:09:04.519 --> 00:09:08.005
HAVE JUMPED ON ONE CRAZY THEORY

00:09:08.006 --> 00:09:09.731
AFTER ANOTHER.

00:09:09.733 --> 00:09:11.854
BARR IS A THOUGHTFUL AND

00:09:11.855 --> 00:09:13.023
DEDICATED CIVIL SERVANT.

00:09:13.024 --> 00:09:15.308
HE CAME OUT OF RETIREMENT, NOT

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:16.422
BECAUSE HE WANTED SOMETHING ON

00:09:16.456 --> 00:09:17.483
HIS RESUME BECAUSE HE’S ALREADY

00:09:17.484 --> 00:09:18.264
DONE SOMETHING.

00:09:18.299 --> 00:09:21.019
HE DID IT BECAUSE HE HAS A

00:09:21.054 --> 00:09:22.418
PROFOUND SENSE OF DUTY TO THIS

00:09:22.452 --> 00:09:22.641
COUNTRY.

00:09:22.675 --> 00:09:25.471
HE AND THE AMERICAN PEOPLE

00:09:25.506 --> 00:09:26.305
DESERVE BETTER.

00:09:26.306 --> 00:09:27.618
AND DON’T IMAGINE THAT BIDEN

00:09:27.619 --> 00:09:29.703
WILL STOP THE LAWLESSNESS IN OUR

00:09:29.737 --> 00:09:31.111
CITIES, BY THE WAY.

00:09:31.146 --> 00:09:33.646
&gt;&gt; I WOULD BE USING LOCAL POLICE

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:36.620
AS WE DID WHEN WE WERE IN

00:09:36.655 --> 00:09:37.951
OFFICE, WHEN THERE WERE RIOTS

00:09:37.985 --> 00:09:39.461
AND FEDERAL PROPERTY AT STAKE,

00:09:39.462 --> 00:09:40.728
WE WERE ABLE TO TAKE CARE OF

00:09:40.729 --> 00:09:41.312
THAT.

00:09:41.346 --> 00:09:46.702
WE WERE ABLE TO TAKE CARE OF,

00:09:46.736 --> 00:09:48.755
OBVIOUSLY, THE USE OF LOCAL

00:09:48.789 --> 00:09:49.624
POLICE.

00:09:49.626 --> 00:09:51.496
&gt;&gt; Laura: OH, REALLY?

00:09:51.497 --> 00:09:52.347
[LAUGHTER]

00:09:52.348 --> 00:09:55.450
HERE IS WHAT OBAMA AND BIDEN

00:09:55.485 --> 00:09:59.554
ACCOMPLISHED IN BALTIMORE.

00:09:59.555 --> 00:10:00.284
[CHANTING]

00:10:00.318 --> 00:10:03.326
THEY DID NOTHING EXCEPT LET

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:04.647
BALTIMORE AND ST. LOUIS,

00:10:04.681 --> 00:10:05.553
FERGUSON BURN!

00:10:05.554 --> 00:10:06.903
IN ELECTING BIDEN, THEY WILL

00:10:06.904 --> 00:10:09.971
MAKE SCENES LIKE THESE PLAY OUT

00:10:09.972 --> 00:10:11.583
IN A NEIGHBORHOOD NEAR YOU.

00:10:11.585 --> 00:10:13.104
AND IF YOU’RE LOOKING COME I

00:10:13.139 --> 00:10:15.759
DON’T KNOW FOR SOME COMFORT,

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:16.830
MODERATION FOR SANITY?

00:10:16.864 --> 00:10:19.346
BIDEN ONLY OFFERS AN INSURANCE

00:10:19.381 --> 00:10:21.407
TO THE FAR LEFT AND THE AOC WING

00:10:21.442 --> 00:10:22.912
OF THIS PARTY.

00:10:22.914 --> 00:10:26.180
&gt;&gt; IF I’M ELECTED, I WILL BE

00:10:26.214 --> 00:10:28.276
GOOD TO GO DOWN AS ONE OF THE

00:10:28.311 --> 00:10:29.797
MOST PROGRESSIVE PRESIDENTS IN

00:10:29.798 --> 00:10:30.214
AMERICAN HISTORY.

00:10:30.215 --> 00:10:32.413
&gt;&gt; Laura: HOW IS THAT?

00:10:32.415 --> 00:10:34.295
YOU WILL BE GOOD TO GO DOWN AS

00:10:34.329 --> 00:10:35.770
THE MOST MANIPULATIVE AND

00:10:35.805 --> 00:10:37.035
PASSIVE PRESIDENTS HIT IN

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:37.652
AMERICAN HISTORY.

00:10:37.686 --> 00:10:38.692
MY GOODNESS.

00:10:38.726 --> 00:10:41.214
THINK OF BILL BARR WHAT HE HAD

00:10:41.215 --> 00:10:44.984
TO ENDURE TODAY AND THEN THINK

